==History==
2016
*The Furnace [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Furnace's cost to 4 [[Elixir]] (from 5 Elixir) {{Balance|Buff}}, its hitpoints by 14% {{Balance|Nerf}}, and its lifetime to 40 seconds (from 50 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}. In addition, the [[Fire Spirit|Fire Spirits]]' area radius was increased to 1.5 tiles (from 1.2 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Furnace's lifetime to 50 seconds (from 40 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2017
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Furnace's hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2018
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirits' damage by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11) ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''.
2020
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Furnace's hitpoints by 16% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 9/9/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/9/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirits' area radius to 1.7 tiles (from 1.5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], decreased the Furnace's spawn time interval to 7 seconds (from 9.9 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, number of Fire Spirits spawned each wave to 1 (from 2) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased its lifetime to 49 seconds (from 50 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}. Its description was also changed, previously saying: "''The Furnace spawns two Fire Spirits at a time. It also makes great brick-oven pancakes.''" ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''. In addition, the Fire Spirits' hitpoints were increased by 109% {{Balance|Buff}}, their damage by 6% {{Balance|Buff}}, their range to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}, and their area radius to 2.5 tiles (from 1.7 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Furnace from Spell Valley to Hog Mountain {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Fire Spirits' area radius to 2.3 tiles (from 2.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the hitpoints of the Furnace by 17% {{Balance|Nerf}}, its lifetime to 33 seconds (from 49 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and its spawn time interval to 6 seconds (from 7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and made the Furnace spawn 1 additional Fire Spirit upon death {{Balance|Add}}. It also decreased the range of the Fire Spirits to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2022
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Fire Spirit's damage by 9% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Furnace's spawn time interval to 5 seconds (from 6 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and its lifetime to 28 seconds (from 33 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirit's range to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Furnace's hitpoints by 0.11% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] changed the Furnace into a troop that can walk and deal damage ''{{Balance|Neutral}}'', as well as increasing the hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}, and removing the death spawn {{Balance|Remove}}. It also changed the Furnace card image ''{{Balance|Neutral}}'', and added a card render to the Furnace's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}. Its description was also changed. Prior to the update, it used to say "''The Furnace spawns one Fire Spirit at a time. It also makes great brick-oven pancakes.''". It also added the Furnace's Evolution {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 7/8/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/8/2025)|maintenance break]] reduced the Furnace's hitpoints by 19% and increased the spawn time for its Fire Spirits to 7 seconds (from 5 seconds).
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]] increased Furnace's Movement Speed to Medium (from Slow).
2026
*On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update increased Furnace's attack speed to 1.7 (from 1.8)
*On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Furnace's range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles)
*On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Furnace's spawn duration to 5 seconds (from 7 seconds)

